<< /A << /BBox [ 53.7578 602.168 293.988 708.363 ] /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Figure 4. System architecture. A Unity client coordinates direct manipulation, voice requests and intents, intermediate wireframe representations, and the 3D scene. Audio is sent to OpenAI whisper-1, whose transcript is processed by gpt-4-turbo to return intents and parameters to Unity. The client requests layouts from the ATISS generative model server, receives generated wireframe layouts, and instantiates furniture in the scene. AWS Polly provides text-to-speech audio output. Users can also directly manipulate the scene and draw wireframes through the client interface.) /C /adbe_style_006000 /ID (AD240624-1800-1099-ADBE-000000014605) /K [ << /MCID 0 /Pg 114 0 R /Type /MCR >> ] /P 93 0 R /Pg 114 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
