<</Type/StructElem/A<</BBox[55.3177 541.33 290.388 706.923]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>/Alt(Figure 6. Box plots of agency, creativity, and effort on a seven-point Likert scale, comparing manual creation in red, scaffolded creation in green, and automatic creation in blue. Manual creation has the highest agency ratings, scaffolded creation is intermediate, and automatic creation is lowest; all pairwise agency differences are significant. Manual creation also has higher creativity ratings than the other two conditions, which do not significantly differ. Effort ratings cluster near the lower-middle of the scale and do not significantly differ. Boxes show the middle half of responses with median lines, whiskers, and plotted means.)/C/adbe_style_008000/ID(AD240624-1800-1099-ADBE-000000019027)/K[0]/P 93 0 R/Pg 116 0 R/S/Figure>>
